        "message": "docs(static): fix route path in serveStatic example to match root access\n\nFix the route path from '/public/**' to '/**' in the static assets\ndocumentation examples. In the example, users are instructed to open\n'http://localhost:3000', which 404s when mounted under '/public/**'\nand causes 'path.join(\"public\", id)' to resolve to 'public/public/index.html'.\n\nFixes #1578\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <redacted@example.invalid>",
